rong> à¤¨à¥‡ à¤¬à¤¤à¤¾à¤¯à¤¾ à¤•à¤¿ à¤‡à¤¸ à¤à¤®à¤“à¤¯à¥‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤®à¤¾à¤§à¥à¤¯à¤® à¤¸à¥‡ à¤›à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤µà¥à¤¯à¤¾à¤µà¤¸à¤¾à¤¯à¤¿à¤• à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤­à¤µ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¾à¤ªà¥à¤¤ à¤¹à¥‹à¤—à¤¾, à¤œà¤¿à¤¸à¤¸à¥‡ à¤µà¥‡ à¤†à¤¤à¥à¤®à¤µà¤¿à¤¶à¥à¤µà¤¾à¤¸ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¸à¤¾à¤¥ à¤…à¤ªà¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¤°à¤¿à¤¯à¤° à¤•à¤¾ à¤šà¥à¤¨à¤¾à¤µ à¤•à¤° à¤¸à¤•à¥‡à¤‚à¤—à¥‡à¥¤</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1345\">à¤‰à¤¨à¥à¤¹à¥‹à¤‚à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¤¹à¤¾ à¤•à¤¿ à¤‡à¤‚à¤Ÿà¤°à¥à¤¨à¤¶à¤¿à¤ª à¤”à¤° à¤ªà¥à¤°à¥‹à¤œà¥‡à¤•à¥à¤Ÿ à¤†à¤§à¤¾à¤°à¤¿à¤¤ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¶à¤¿à¤•à¥à¤·à¤£ à¤›à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤­à¤µà¤¿à¤·à¥à¤¯ à¤•à¥€ à¤šà¥à¤¨à¥Œà¤¤à¤¿à¤¯à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ à¤¤à¥ˆà¤¯à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤—à¤¾à¥¤</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1408\">à¤‡à¤¸ à¤…à¤µà¤¸à¤° à¤ªà¤° à¤¡à¥‰. à¤¨à¥ˆà¤¨à¤¾ à¤¸à¤¹à¤¿à¤¤ à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤¯ à¤—à¤£à¤®à¤¾à¤¨à¥à¤¯ à¤µà¥à¤¯à¤•à¥à¤¤à¤¿ à¤­à¥€ à¤‰à¤ªà¤¸à¥à¤¥à¤¿à¤¤ à¤°à¤¹à¥‡à¥¤</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1462\">ðŸŒŸ à¤¯à¥à¤µà¤¾à¤“à¤‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¸à¤°à¥à¤µà¤¾à¤‚à¤—à¥€à¤£ à¤µà¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤¸ à¤•à¥€ à¤¦à¤¿à¤¶à¤¾ à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤•à¤¦à¤®</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1685\">à¤¯à¤¹ à¤¸à¤®à¤à¥Œà¤¤à¤¾ à¤•à¥‡à¤µà¤² à¤à¤• à¤”à¤ªà¤šà¤¾à¤°à¤¿à¤•à¤¤à¤¾ à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚, à¤¬à¤²à¥à¤•à¤¿ à¤¯à¥à¤µà¤¾à¤“à¤‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¸à¤°à¥à¤µà¤¾à¤‚à¤—à¥€à¤£ à¤µà¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤¸ à¤•à¥€ à¤¦à¤¿à¤¶à¤¾ à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤à¤• à¤ à¥‹à¤¸ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¯à¤¾à¤¸ à¤¹à¥ˆà¥¤ à¤¶à¤¿à¤•à¥à¤·à¤¾ à¤”à¤° à¤¸à¤¾à¤®à¤¾à¤œà¤¿à¤• à¤¸à¤‚à¤—à¤ à¤¨à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¬à¥€à¤š à¤¯à¤¹ à¤¸à¤¹à¤¯à¥‹à¤— à¤›à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤µà¥à¤¯à¤µà¤¹à¤¾à¤°à¤¿à¤• à¤œà¥à¤žà¤¾à¤¨, à¤¨à¥‡à¤¤à¥ƒà¤¤à¥à¤µ à¤•à¥Œà¤¶à¤² à¤”à¤° à¤¸à¤¾à¤®à¤¾à¤œà¤¿à¤• à¤œà¥à¤¡à¤¼à¤¾à¤µ à¤•à¤¾ à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤­à¤µ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¦à¤¾à¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤—à¤¾à¥¤</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1706\">ðŸ“Œ à¤¨à¤¿à¤·à¥à¤•à¤°à¥à¤·</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1935\">à¤°à¤¾à¤œà¤•à¥€à¤¯ à¤®à¤¹à¤¾à¤µà¤¿à¤¦à¥à¤¯à¤¾à¤²à¤¯ à¤”à¤° à¤®à¤¹à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤®à¤¾ à¤—à¤¾à¤‚à¤§à¥€ à¤¸à¤‚à¤—à¤ à¤¨ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¬à¥€à¤š à¤¹à¥à¤† à¤¯à¤¹ à¤à¤®à¤“à¤¯à¥‚ à¤›à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤‰à¤œà¥à¤œà¥à¤µà¤² à¤­à¤µà¤¿à¤·à¥à¤¯ à¤•à¥€ à¤¦à¤¿à¤¶à¤¾ à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤à¤• à¤¸à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤®à¤• à¤ªà¤¹à¤² à¤¹à¥ˆà¥¤ à¤‡à¤¸à¤¸à¥‡ à¤¶à¤¿à¤•à¥à¤·à¤¾ à¤•à¤¾ à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤° à¤¬à¥‡à¤¹à¤¤à¤° à¤¹à¥‹à¤—à¤¾ à¤”à¤° à¤›à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤° à¤°à¥‹à¤œà¤—à¤¾à¤° à¤à¤µà¤‚ à¤¸à¤¾à¤®à¤¾à¤œà¤¿à¤• à¤•à¥à¤·à¥‡à¤¤à¥à¤° à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤¨à¤ˆ à¤Šà¤‚à¤šà¤¾à¤‡à¤¯à¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¾à¤ªà¥à¤¤ à¤•à¤° à¤¸à¤•à¥‡à¤‚à¤—à¥‡à¥¤</p>','','','','',1,0,'2026-02-12 05:01:15','2026-02-12 05:01:15'),
(9,1,'Dr. Krishan Midha Inaugurates AI-Based Computer Lab in Jind to Empower Youth','krishan-middha','assets/uploads/blogs/blog_1770872997.jpg','<h2 data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"780\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\">Dr. Krishan Midha Launches AI-Based Computer Lab in Jind</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1062\">In a significant step toward digital empowerment and youth skill development, <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"881\">Dr. Krishan Midha</strong> inaugurated an <strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"922\">AI-based Computer Lab</strong> in Jind, Haryana. This initiative aims to strengthen technical education and prepare young students for the rapidly evolving digital world.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1195\">The event witnessed the presence of dignitaries, educators, and students who welcomed this progressive move toward modern learning.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1200\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1257\">Strengthening the Foundation of Self-Reliant Haryana</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1325\">While addressing the gathering, Dr. Krishan Midha emphasized that:</p>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1413\">&ldquo;The foundation of a self-reliant Haryana will become strong through skilled youth.&rdquo;</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1691\">He highlighted that today\'s era demands <strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1535\">technical education, digital literacy, and artificial intelligence knowledge</strong>. By integrating AI-based learning tools, students will gain exposure to modern technologies that enhance both employment and entrepreneurial opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1752\">Focus on Artificial Intelligence and Digital Skills</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1797\">The newly inaugurated lab is equipped with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1828\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1828\">Advanced computer systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1859\">AI-based learning software</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1895\">Digital skill development tools</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1933\">Technical training infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1974\">This facility will help students learn:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2015\">Artificial Intelligence (AI) basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2041\">Computer applications</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2062\">Digital literacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2100\">Technical and practical knowledge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2179\">Such exposure will improve students\' confidence and make them industry-ready.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2233\">Boost to Employment and Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2276\">The AI-based computer lab is expected to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2465\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2322\">Increase technical awareness among youth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2355\">Improve employability skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2403\">Promote digital transformation in education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2465\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2465\">Prepare students for competitive exams and corporate jobs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2675\">With the rise of automation and AI technologies, skill-based training has become essential. This initiative aligns with Haryana&rsquo;s vision of creating a technologically advanced and employment-ready generation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2680\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2715\">A Step Towards Digital Haryana</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2774\">The inauguration reflects the government\'s commitment to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2899\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2818\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2818\">Modernizing educational infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2857\">Encouraging innovation in learning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2899\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2899\">Supporting youth development programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"3022\">By providing access to AI-powered tools, students from Jind and nearby areas will benefit from quality digital education.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3027\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3042\">Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3352\">The inauguration of the <strong data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3122\">AI-Based Computer Lab in Jind by Dr. Krishan Midha</strong> marks a crucial step toward empowering Haryana&rsquo;s youth with advanced technical skills. As India moves toward a digital future, such initiatives will play a vital role in building a skilled, confident, and self-reliant generation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3494\">This development is not just about a computer lab &mdash; it is about shaping the future of Haryana through education, innovation, and technology.</p>','','','','',1,0,'2026-02-12 05:09:57','2026-02-12 05:09:57'),
