las, pivot tables and dashboards. Ideal for office jobs, MIS, accounting and data analysis roles.','advance excel course, advanced excel training, excel course for jobs, excel formulas course, pivot table training, excel dashboard course, mis executive course','INR',1,'2026-02-02 14:41:14','2026-02-12 09:15:46',1,'Months'),
(6,5,'Python','python','','<h2 data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"238\">ðŸ“˜ Course Name</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"268\"><strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"268\">Python Programming Course</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"273\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"298\">ðŸ“ Course Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"605\">The <strong data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"332\">Python Programming Course</strong> is designed to help students and beginners learn programming from scratch using one of the most powerful and popular programming languages in the world. Python is widely used in software development, data analysis, automation, artificial intelligence, and web development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"821\">This course focuses on <strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"691\">clear concepts, practical coding, and real-world examples</strong>, making it ideal for students who want to build a strong programming foundation and start a career in IT or software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"853\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"909\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"963\">Understand core programming concepts using Python</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1005\">Write clean and efficient Python code</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1047\">Build small applications and programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1087\">Automate tasks using Python scripts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1144\">Prepare for advanced fields like Data Science and AI</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1196\">ðŸ“š Course Syllabus / What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1219\">âœ” Python Basics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1246\">Introduction to Python</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1274\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1274\">Installing Python &amp; IDE</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1315\">Variables, data types, and operators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1343\">âœ” Control Structures</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1381\">Conditional statements (if, else)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1404\">Loops (for, while)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1427\">Break and continue</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1456\">âœ” Functions &amp; Modules</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1489\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1489\">Defining and using functions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1527\">Built-in and user-defined modules</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1548\">Code reusability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1573\">âœ” Data Structures</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1611\">Lists, tuples, sets, dictionaries</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1636\">Working with strings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1669\">Data manipulation techniques</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1715\">âœ” File Handling &amp; Basics of Automation</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1808\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1745\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1745\">Reading and writing files</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1779\">Error handling (try &amp; except)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1808\">Basic automation scripts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1851\">ðŸ‘¨&zwj;ðŸŽ“ Who Can Join This Course?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1880\">This course is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1909\">Students from any stream</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1949\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1949\">Beginners with no coding background</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1987\">IT and computer science aspirants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2016\">Job seekers and freshers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2053\">Anyone interested in programming</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2088\">ðŸ’¼ Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2172\">After completing the Python Programming Course, students can explore roles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2173