(7,5,'Java','java','','<h2 data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"261\">ðŸ“˜ Course Name</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"289\"><strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"289\">Java Programming Course</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"294\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"319\">ðŸ“ Course Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"608\">The <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"351\">Java Programming Course</strong> is designed to build a strong foundation in object-oriented programming using Java, one of the most widely used programming languages in the software industry. Java is used in web applications, enterprise software, Android development, and backend systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"811\">This course focuses on <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"691\">concept clarity, logical thinking, and hands-on coding</strong>, making it suitable for beginners as well as students who want to pursue a professional career in software development.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"843\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"899\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"951\">Understand core programming concepts using Java</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1006\">Write structured and object-oriented Java programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1063\">Develop console-based and basic application programs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1127\">Understand how Java is used in real-world software projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1181\">Prepare for advanced Java and backend development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1233\">ðŸ“š Course Syllabus / What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1260\">âœ” Java Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1291\">Introduction to Java &amp; JVM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1332\">Data types, variables, and operators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1362\">Input and output handling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1390\">âœ” Control Statements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1413\">If-else conditions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1446\">Loops (for, while, do-while)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1462\">Switch case</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1505\">âœ” Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1529\">Classes and objects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1545\">Inheritance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1562\">Polymorphism</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1596\">Encapsulation and abstraction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1635\">âœ” Exception Handling &amp; Packages</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1659\">Try, catch, finally</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1687\">User-defined exceptions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1726\">Java packages and access modifiers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1763\">âœ” Basics of Java Applications</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1843\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1786\">Arrays and strings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1811\">File handling basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1843\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1843\">Introduction to collections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1886\">ðŸ‘¨&zwj;ðŸŽ“ Who Can Join This Course?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1915\">This course is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1944\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1944\">Students from any stream</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1989\">Beginners with no prior coding knowledge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2024\">Computer science &amp; IT students</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2066\">Job seekers aiming for software roles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2103\">Anyone interested in programming</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2138\">ðŸ’¼ Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2