(8,6,'Web Designing','web-designing','','<h2 data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"237\">ðŸ“˜ Course Name</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"262\"><strong data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"262\">Web Designing Course</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"267\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"292\">ðŸ“ Course Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"587\">The <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"321\">Web Designing Course</strong> is designed to teach students how to create attractive, responsive, and user-friendly websites using modern web technologies. This course focuses on both <strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"497\">design principles</strong> and <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"535\">practical website development</strong>, helping learners build real websites from scratch.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"739\">Students will learn how websites work, how to design layouts, and how to create responsive designs suitable for desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"771\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"827\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<li data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"875\">Design professional and responsive websites</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"922\">Understand website layout and UI/UX basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"987\">Create static websites using HTML, CSS, and basic JavaScript</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\n<p data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1031\">Build real-world web pages and projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1084\">Start freelancing or entry-level web design jobs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1136\">ðŸ“š Course Syllabus / What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1162\">âœ” Web Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1184\">How websites work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1221\">Domain, hosting &amp; browser basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1254\">Introduction to UI/UX design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1296\">âœ” HTML (HyperText Markup Language)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1328\">Page structure and elements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1357\">Forms, tables, and links</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1375\">Semantic HTML</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1413\">âœ” CSS (Cascading Style Sheets)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1437\">Styling and layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1475\">Flexbox &amp; basic responsive design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Colors, fonts, and animations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1535\">âœ” Basic JavaScript</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1566\">Introduction to JavaScript</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-