(9,6,'Cyber Security','cyber-security','','<h2 data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"244\">ðŸ“˜ Course Name</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"270\"><strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"270\">Cyber Security Course</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"275\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"300\">ðŸ“ Course Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"636\">The <strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"330\">Cyber Security Course</strong> is designed to provide students with essential knowledge and practical skills to protect computer systems, networks, and data from cyber threats. With the rapid growth of digital platforms, cyber security professionals are in high demand across IT companies, government organizations, and private sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"824\">This course focuses on <strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"747\">fundamentals of cyber security, ethical practices, and real-world threat awareness</strong>, making it suitable for beginners who want to start a career in IT security.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"829\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"856\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"912\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<li data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"960\">\r\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"960\">Understand cyber threats and security risks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1021\">Learn how hackers attack systems and how to prevent them</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1068\">Protect data, networks, and digital assets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1122\">Understand ethical hacking concepts (basic level)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1186\">Build a strong foundation for advanced cyber security roles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1238\">ðŸ“š Course Syllabus / What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1275\">âœ” Cyber Security Fundamentals</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1310\">Introduction to cyber security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1349\">Types of cyber threats and attacks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1387\">Malware, phishing, and ransomware</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1422\">âœ” Network &amp; System Security</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1447\">Basics of networking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1481\">Firewalls and antivirus tools</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1512\">Securing operating systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1544\">âœ” Ethical Hacking Basics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1656\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1581\">Understanding hacking techniques</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1625\">Password security and encryption basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1656\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1656\">Ethical vs illegal hacking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1685\">âœ” Web &amp; Data Security</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1713\">Website security basics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1745\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1745\">Data protection and privacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1792\">Cyber laws and compliance (basic overview)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1829\">âœ” Practical Awareness &amp; Tools</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1926\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1857\">Security tools overview</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1885\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1885\">Safe internet practices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1926\">Real-world cyber attack case studies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1969\">ðŸ‘¨&zwj;ðŸŽ“ Who Can Join This Course?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1998\">This course is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2024\">Students and freshers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2062\">IT and computer science aspirants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2105\">Beginners interested in cyber security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2144\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2144\">Government &amp; private job aspirants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2187\">Anyone wanting to learn digital safety</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2222\">ðŸ’¼ Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<p data-s