a-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2781\">Suitable for beginners</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2824\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2824\">Course completion certificate provided</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','[]','[]','{\"amount\":\"4500\",\"description\":\"\"}','assets/uploads/courses/course_1770118208.png','Cyber Security Course | Ethical Hacking & IT Security Training','Learn cyber security fundamentals, ethical hacking basics and IT security skills. Ideal for beginners aiming for a career in cyber security.','cyber security course, cyber security training, ethical hacking course, information security course, network security training, cyber security for beginners, it security course','INR',1,'2026-02-03 11:30:08','2026-02-12 09:14:20',1,'Months'),
(10,7,'Financial Accounting','financial-accounting','','<h2 data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"239\">ðŸ“˜ Course Name</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"271\"><strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"271\">Financial Accounting Course</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"276\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"301\">ðŸ“ Course Overview</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"593\">The <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"337\">Financial Accounting Course</strong> is designed to help students understand the fundamentals of accounting and financial record-keeping used by businesses and organizations. This course focuses on <strong data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"532\">practical accounting concepts</strong>, financial statements, and real-world business transactions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"779\">Students will gain strong knowledge of how to record, classify, summarize, and analyze financial data, making this course ideal for commerce students, job seekers, and business owners.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"811\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"867\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<li data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"923\">Understand basic accounting principles and concepts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<p data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"967\">Record business transactions accurately</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1000\">Prepare financial statements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1047\">Analyze financial data for decision making</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1109\">Build a strong foundation for advanced accounting courses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1161\">ðŸ“š Course Syllabus / What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1188\">âœ” Accounting Basics</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1219\">Introduction to accounting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1258\">Accounting principles and concepts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1280\">Types of accounts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1306\">âœ” Journal &amp; Ledger</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1326\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1326\">Journal entries</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1345\">Ledger posting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1375\">Trial balance preparation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1405\">âœ” Financial Statements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1431\">Profit &amp; Loss Account</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1449\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1449\">Balance Sheet</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1481\">Cash Flow Statement (basic)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1512\">âœ” Business Transactions</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1546\">Purchase and sales accounting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1580\">Expenses and income recording</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1615\">Adjustments and final accounts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1645\">âœ” Practical Accounting</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1680\">Real-world accounting examples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1711\">Manual accounting practice</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1759\">Introduction to accounting software (basic)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1802\">ðŸ‘¨&zwj;ðŸŽ“ Who Can Join This Course?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1831\">This course is suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1976\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1853\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1853\">Commerce students</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1879\">BBA / B.Com aspirants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1908\">Job seekers and freshers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1928\">Business owners</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1976\">Anyone interested in accounting and finance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"1981\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2011\">ðŸ’¼ Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2083\">After completing the Financial Accounting Course, students can work as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\n<p