(14,8,'Video Editing','video-editing','','<h2 data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"186\">ðŸŽ¬ Video Editing Course</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"212\">ðŸ“Œ Course Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"509\">The <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"241\">Video Editing Course</strong> is designed to teach students how to edit professional-quality videos for social media, YouTube, films, advertisements, and digital marketing. This course focuses on <strong data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"440\">practical, hands-on training</strong> using industry-standard video editing tools and real-world projects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"659\">Students will learn how to cut, trim, enhance, and transform raw footage into engaging videos with effects, transitions, sound, and motion graphics.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"692\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"748\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<li data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"807\">Edit professional videos using modern editing software</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"879\">Create engaging content for YouTube, Instagram, and other platforms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"932\">Apply transitions, effects, and color correction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"989\">Add background music, sound effects, and voice-overs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1043\">Build a strong portfolio for jobs and freelancing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1078\">ðŸ“˜ What You Will Learn</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=