(15,9,'AutoCAD','autocad','','<h2 data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"167\">ðŸ—ï¸ AutoCAD Course</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"193\">ðŸ“Œ Course Overview</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"518\">The <strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"216\">AutoCAD Course</strong> is designed to teach students how to create accurate 2D and basic 3D technical drawings used in engineering, architecture, construction, and manufacturing industries. This course focuses on <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"436\">practical drafting skills</strong> using AutoCAD software, making learners job-ready for technical and design roles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"630\">Students will learn to prepare professional drawings, layouts, and blueprints according to industry standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"635\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"663\">ðŸŽ¯ Course Objectives</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"719\">After completing this course, students will be able to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<li data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"769\">Create professional 2D drawings using AutoCAD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"812\">Understand technical drawing standards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"862\">Draft layouts, plans, and sections accurately</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"907\">Work with layers, dimensions, and blocks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"964\">Prepare drawings for real-world engineering projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"999\">ðŸ“˜ What You Will Learn</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1043\">Introduction to AutoCAD &amp; CAD Concepts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1081\">AutoCAD Interface &amp; Drawing Tools</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1132\">Drawing Commands (Line, Circle, Arc, Polyline)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1184\">Editing Commands (Trim, Extend, Offset, Mirror)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1217\">Layers, Blocks &amp; Annotations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1253\">Dimensioning &amp; Scale Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1287\">Layouts, Viewports &amp; Printing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1323\">Basic 3D Modeling (Intro Level)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1359\">Industry-based Drawing Projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1391\">ðŸ›  Software Covered</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1418\">AutoCAD (Latest Version)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1465\">ðŸ‘¨&zwj;ðŸŽ“ Who Should Join This Course?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1500\">Engineering &amp; diploma students</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1544\">Architecture &amp; interior design students</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1588\">Civil, mechanical &amp; electrical learners</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1616\">Technical job aspirants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1654\">Anyone interested in CAD drafting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1659\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1690\">ðŸ’¼ Career Opportunities</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1749\">After completing the AutoCAD Course, students can work as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1769\">AutoCAD Drafter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1786\">CAD Designer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1806\">Civil Draftsman</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1831\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1831\">Mechanical Draftsman</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1858\">Junior Design Engineer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1889\">ðŸ† Course Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"2064\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1931\">Practical, industry-oriented training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1972\">Beginner-friendly learning structure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1998\">Hands-on project work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2030\">High demand technical skill</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2064\">Course completion certificate</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2069\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2094\">â³ Course Duration</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2154\"><strong data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2110\">Duration:</strong> Flexible (Short-term / Long-term options)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2203\"><strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2166\">Mode:</strong> Classroom / Practical Lab Training</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','[]','[]','{\"amount\":\"4500\",\"description\":\"\"}','assets/uploads/courses/course_1770119734.png','AutoCAD Course | Professional CAD Design & Drafting Training','Learn AutoCAD from basics to advanced with practical drafting projects. Ideal for civil, mechanical, architectural and technical careers. ','autocad course, autocad training, cad drafting course, autocad for civil engineers, autocad for mechanical, autocad design course, cad designer training, learn autocad','INR',1,'2026-02-03 11:50:00','2026-02-12 09:12:23',1,'Months'),
(16,2,'FLAI(First Lesson of Artificial Intelligence)','flai-first-lesson-of-artificial-intelligence-','','<h1 data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"327\">ðŸ“˜ Course Summary</h1>\r\n<h1 data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"380\"><strong data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"380\">FLAI &ndash; First Lesson of Artificial Intelligence</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"579\"><strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"432\">FLAI (First Lesson of Artificial Intelligence)</strong> is a beginner-friendly foundational course designed to introduce students to the world of Artificial Intelligence and its real-world applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"633\">This course helps college-going students understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<li data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"669\">What is Artificial Intelligence?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"698\">How AI works in daily life</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"732\">How AI is used in Cybersecurity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"775\">How AI is transforming Digital Marketing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"838\">How AI tools can be used in Google Sheets, Slides, and Forms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"885\">Career opportunities in AI-driven industries</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"973\">FLAI focuses on both <strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"950\">concept clarity and practical exposure</strong>, enabling students to:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1231\">âœ” Understand basic AI concepts<br data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1008\">âœ” Differentiate between human intelligence and machine intelligence<br data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1078\">âœ” Explore real AI tools like ChatGPT &amp; Gemini<br data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\">âœ” Learn how AI improves productivity<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\">âœ” Discover career paths in AI, Digital Marketing &amp; Cybersecurity</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1353\">This course builds a strong foundation for students who want to enter the future-ready world of Artificial Intelligence.</p>','[]','[]','{\"amount\":\"\",\"description\":\"\"}','assets/uploads/courses/course_1772103207.webp','','','','INR',1,'2026-02-26 10:53:27','2026-02-26 10:53:27',30,'Days');
