(6,'App Development Internship','app-development-internship','<h2>App Development Internship</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Offered by: MG Education &amp; Social Development Organisation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ Internship Overview</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>MG Education &amp; Social Development Organisation is offering a <strong>hands-on App Development Internship</strong> designed to help students and aspiring developers gain real-world experience in mobile application development. This internship focuses on practical learning, industry-relevant skills, and project-based training to prepare interns for careers in the tech industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>ðŸŽ¯ Internship Objectives</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>To provide practical exposure to modern app development technologies</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>To help interns understand the complete app development lifecycle</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>To build problem-solving and logical thinking skills</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>To prepare interns for professional roles in mobile and software development</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>ðŸ“š Internship Curriculum</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ Module 1: Fundamentals of App Development</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Introduction to Mobile Applications</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Types of Apps (Native, Hybrid, Web Apps)</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Understanding App Architecture</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>UI/UX Basics for Mobile Apps</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ Module 2: Programming Basics</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Programming Logic &amp; Flow</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Variables, Conditions, Loops</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Functions &amp; Modular Coding</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Debugging Techniques</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ Module 3: Android / Cross-Platform Development</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Introduction to Android / Flutter / React Native (as applicable)</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>App Screens &amp; Navigat